{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Wicked Engine",
    "steam_appid": 1967460,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wicked Engine is a small, fast, experimental 3D engine with a modern graphics. Everything you create with it is completely yours, without any strings attached, for eternity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Modern graphics engine, fully utilizing DirectX 12 and Vulkan, with the latest features like hardware accelerated ray tracing, HDR and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Written in C++ with focus on performance<br>- Lua scripting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Open GLTF, FBX, OBJ and VRM models, images, videos, audio, text and create scenes with them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- VRM character support, create characters in other software and import them easily<br>- Just a single executable, no installation required (+some additional sample assets included with the download, check them out in the Content Browser) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- No internet connection required, no data collection</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- This is the packaged version of the open source Wicked Engine. This version can be used to edit 3D scenes and run LUA scripts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- The version with the latest features and full source code which can be used for C++ development is available on GitHub.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wicked Engine is a small, fast, experimental 3D engine with a modern graphics. Everything you create with it is completely yours, without any strings attached, for eternity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Modern graphics engine, fully utilizing DirectX 12 and Vulkan, with the latest features like hardware accelerated ray tracing, HDR and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Written in C++ with focus on performance<br>- Lua scripting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Open GLTF, FBX, OBJ and VRM models, images, videos, audio, text and create scenes with them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- VRM character support, create characters in other software and import them easily<br>- Just a single executable, no installation required (+some additional sample assets included with the download, check them out in the Content Browser) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- No internet connection required, no data collection</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- This is the packaged version of the open source Wicked Engine. This version can be used to edit 3D scenes and run LUA scripts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- The version with the latest features and full source code which can be used for C++ development is available on GitHub.</p>",
